  partName: Middle Front Gasket
  description: The Middle Front Gasket is a small, thin-flat gasket situated at the
    middle-center-front of the engine, constructed from Material.004, which seals
    the engine block or cylinder head to prevent oil and coolant leaks. This gasket
    is vital for maintaining the engine's performance and reliability, and a notable
    aspect is that it must be replaced if damaged to prevent engine damage. The Middle
    Front Gasket's small size belies its importance in overall engine reliability
    and efficiency.
